WEBVTT

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.220
We walk and walk, yet we cannot find the entrance.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.730
Yasumasa-<i>chan</i>. Yorinobu-<i>chan.</i>

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:21.820
Run ahead and find the entrance!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.710
If it isn't Masamune-<i>dono.</i>

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:41.520
Yorinobu-<i>dono</i> and Yasumasa-<i>dono</i> as well.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:47.620
Are you here on behalf of the Minister of the Left?

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:04.230
It has been quite dangerous lately.
We have been careful to lock up.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.780
My, my!

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:21.060
Where were you hiding all these beautiful women?

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:26.160
Haruaki-<i>dono</i>, you are truly an <i>onmyouji</i> of the times!

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:29.760
About what we discussed.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:33.330
You mean, Ashiya Douman?

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:38.440
I, too, heard stories of him during my childhood.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:43.480
You and Ashiya Douman often pitted your skills against one another.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:47.970
I have heard he can curse others to death quite easily.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:51.150
Yasumasa-<i>dono.</i>

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:57.030
The Ashiya Douman you speak of is not the one who carries the name now.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.860
A second generation who has inherited the name?

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.800
Yet his skill is true.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:06.800
Michinaga-<i>sama</i> wishes to have that man by his side.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.330
Do you believe that to be wise, Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>?

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.940
He can take the lives of others with mere chanting

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.180
and call forth evil spirits.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.780
Evil spirits?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:24.190
How long do you plan to converse so seriously?

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:27.490
We are surrounded by beautiful women!

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:31.660
Um, Masamune-<i>sama</i>. I believe these women are <i>shiki</i> dolls.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:36.630
What? Are you blind, Yorinobu-<i>chan</i>?

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:41.660
This is why, as the next in line for the Genji family...

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.240
Masamune-<i>sama</i>?

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.510
Meow.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.510
Meow?

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.750
Masamune-<i>dono</i>, you have had too much to drink.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.580
No, this is...!

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.520
Did he drink catnip wine?!

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.050
An evil spirit.

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:08.030
Evil spirit...

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:25.040
It comes again!

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.920
Kiyome...

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.430
Kiyome!

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.920
What is this?!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:04:00.820
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:08.920
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:16.130
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:25.160
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:34.520
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:42.360
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:50.270
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:04:50.270 --> 00:05:00.260
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:06.450
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:10.950
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:15.950
"MOTHER DAUGHTER"

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.630
Stop right there!

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.880
We've finally caught you.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:43.510
This is your doing, isn't it? Seimei!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:48.760
What are you on about so early in the morning?

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.160
Oh, what are you doing, Shiki-nyan?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.530
Shiki-nyan?

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.160
Well it's a <i>shiki</i> doll so that's its name.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.230
Or do you think Shiki-Shiki or Shikicchi is better?

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:01.740
I don't care what you call it.
What is the meaning of this?

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:08.410
The money I had been saving up for
Raiko-<i>sama</i> had recently been disappearing.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.710
"Sorry, I was ordered to do it..."

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.080
I-It can't be helped!

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.780
There's a Buddha statue I've just got to have.

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:18.440
It's this small, but it's so attractive...

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.420
You want your palm read?

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.590
3,677 <i>mon</i>!

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:25.460
Huh?

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:31.870
I will have you return the 3,677 <i>mon</i> that you've taken until now!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.770
I-I already used it for a down payment on the statue...

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.710
Then, go and get the money back!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.270
Excuse us!

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:40.940
Oh!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.610
You are Yasumasa-<i>sama.</i>

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.750
And Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, as well.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:50.950
We have come today to ask a favor of Seimei-<i>dono.</i>

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:54.320
Me? No way! I don't know what this is about,

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.660
but I bet it has something to do with aristocrats!

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.060
I don't want to be involved.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.260
A request from Michinaga-<i>sama,</i> the most powerful man in the capital,

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:05.430
should result in a nice reward!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:06.330
I don't want to.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.500
3,677 <i>mon.</i>

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.140
It can't be helped.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.110
You two are coming along, too!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.570
Hey, where is the entrance?

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.780
Wait here.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.960
What in the world is going on?

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:36.260
I have heard this is the house where Seimei-<i>san</i> was born.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:39.170
Where she was born?

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:41.670
I have a much more important question for you.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.760
Wh-What is it, Yorinobu?

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:52.270
You and Seimei-<i>sama</i>. D-Do you sleep together?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.160
This is quite the mess.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:07.900
Did the best <i>onmyouji</i> of this generation have his <i>shiki</i> turn on him?

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.330
A Horror.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.570
A Horror, you say?

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:18.810
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>. Pardon me, but you are not a Makai Knight or Alchemist.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.010
What do you know of Horrors?

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:22.010
Kiyome!

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:25.980
They are evil spirits that appear from another world, Makai,

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:30.220
to possess humans and consume them.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.750
That's right.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:36.090
Seimei, I order you to eliminate this Horror.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.160
I refuse.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.690
I have told you this would happen.

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:47.030
Horrors are attracted to the dark emotions of man.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:50.770
This Horror involves you.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.170
Involves me?

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:57.110
The Horror from last night called out the name, Kiyome.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:00.380
Your true name.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:03.720
There is only one Horror who would call for you.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.750
It can't be...

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:24.410
We have finished talking.
You two may return home.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.770
Where is Seimei?

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:28.210
That is none of your concern.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.940
It is of my concern! Without her...

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:36.980
It seems she would like to do this job alone.

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:38.890
Alone?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:46.060
Um, a job from the Minister of the Left.
What was the reward?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:50.110
As expected of Seimei, she took quite a hefty amount from me.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.460
Huh?! Payment up front?

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:27.660
What's wrong? Is that all the strength you have?

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.830
Just a bit more...

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:32.430
Looks like you're having trouble.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:39.140
So you've come, Seimei.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:45.780
Like in the South, you're trying to awaken a Horror in the Kumano?

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.680
How uncreative.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.920
If the Horror was sealed,

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:56.160
it means a normal Makai Knight was unable to defeat it.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:11:02.190
Are you trying to say that Horror is Princess Katsurako, my mother?

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.660
Seimei is the child of a Horror?

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:14.640
That face! That face! Are you surprised?

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.550
Can Horrors birth children?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.980
Of course they cannot.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:25.120
Even if they did, they would chomp on its head and eat it up.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.820
Then, that was a lie.

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.720
Use your head.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:34.030
She became a Horror after she gave birth to Seimei.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:35.130
I see.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:38.070
Seimei's father, Abeno Shidamaru,

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:44.470
was expected to take over the
Abe family, but one day he disappeared.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.710
He was probably eaten by his wife who became a Horror.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.180
Or perhaps...

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.050
Perhaps, what?

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:54.720
He sacrificed himself to seal her.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:12:00.150
Shidamaru was a Makai Alchemist and could not eliminate Horrors.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.560
He could only seal her between the dimensions of yin and yang.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:09.230
However, such a seal is weak and may soon break.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:13.270
Please order me to defeat that Horror.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:14.870
You?

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:19.210
Your armor is sealed and you cannot do anything alone.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.800
What do you plan to do?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.690
I know what you want to ask.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:43.800
I do not remember how long it has been since Kiyome's mother became a Horror.

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:45.230
How did it happen?

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:47.700
You know of Kamono Yasunori?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.370
He is an <i>onmyou</i> professor and a close aide of Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.980
As <i>onmyouji</i>, the Kamo family stands at the top.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:59.450
Princess Katsurako was the daughter of Yasunori.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:04.090
Kiyome has inherited the blood of both the Kamo and Abe family.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:08.720
She was fated to be the strongest of all <i>onmyouji.</i>

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.290
What are you doing, Kiyome?

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:12.990
Look, Grandfather.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.090
I can exorcise evil spirits!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:17.760
There!

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:30.640
Kiyome!

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:33.110
Why? Why must she be locked up?!

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:36.620
Eliminating Horrors is the job of a Makai Knight!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.450
Kiyome will inherit the Abe family!

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:43.420
She will read the stars, work for the aristocrats,

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.260
and protect the Heavenly Emperor!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.960
I'd rather exorcise evil spirits than do such things!

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.990
And soon, what I feared came to be.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.170
Damn Horrors!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:05.310
They plan to eliminate her before she becomes a true threat!

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.800
So they are all aiming for Kiyome.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.480
I will not let them touch my daughter!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.180
Honey!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.880
Dear, I beg of you!

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:43.150
My spells can only allow me to absorb the Horrors within me!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.890
Please destroy me along with them!

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:46.250
Mother!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:56.690
I will not let you go alone.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:01.500
This is for our daughter.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:05.770
Using his own life to create the seal,

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:10.400
Shidamaru drew his last breath together with Princess Katsurako.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:18.790
I buried the two of them in the sacred ground of Kumano.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.390
Then, Seimei...

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:24.560
She saw everything.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:27.130
And one day...

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:30.060
Where are you going, Kiyome?

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:34.240
I will become a destroyer of the evil spirits known as Horrors.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:39.040
I will not allow such a thing!
You will inherit the Abe family!

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:43.110
My mother and father sacrificed themselves for me to live.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:46.380
So that such a thing never happens again,

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.250
I will fight against the Horrors.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.320
Has the seal been broken?

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.220
Horrors only think of consuming humans.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:01.400
Even so, she is obsessed with this house and her daughter.

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:05.330
Are you having Seimei kill her own mother?!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.130
It cannot be helped.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.500
It is something only she can do.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:12.770
To begin with, that is no longer her mother.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.810
It is a mere Horror.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.510
I am at fault for everything.

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:21.330
I could not save my son nor his wife.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.250
Shiki!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.420
You know where Seimei is, don't you?

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:32.380
"Yes."

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.660
Take me there faster than the wind!

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:32.830
It is my duty to eliminate all Horrors!

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:34.320
I see!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:42.470
Well, this is a surprise.

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:46.340
I am the one who taught her how to use those spells.

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:48.540
Go, Makai Knight.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:02.720
Seimei, why didn't you tell me?

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:03.780
Why?!

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:10.030
Your mother, Princess Katsurako became a Horror.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:13.800
The one who sealed her away was your father and grandfather.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.790
Now she only thinks of revenge.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:23.580
Look, the seal is breaking.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:28.150
Last night, the mere energy that leaked from the seal

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:31.250
caused great trouble at the Abe house.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:33.490
If the Horror itself emerges from the seal...

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:38.320
Your way of doing things is too roundabout. Let me do it.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.760
As expected.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:45.500
Douma Houshi-<i>sama</i> said you would say that.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.100
Douma Houshi?

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:50.040
He said that even if your mother had become a Horror,

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.040
you would not be able to toss her aside.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:56.170
Now, let her free and get your revenge.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:04.510
These vines are my father's body and spirit. To go this far...

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:20.800
Stop!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:23.140
Seimei! Don't do such stupid things!

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:26.310
Raiko! Why are you here?

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:28.880
I understand how you feel.

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.940
You want to destroy your mother's Horror, don't you?

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:40.290
Goodness, what will I do with you?

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:43.090
Just how naive can you be, Golden Knight?

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:48.230
That woman is here to release the seal on her beloved mother.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.820
You're wrong! Seimei wouldn't...

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.230
Is it true?

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:00.610
If that's true, then I will...

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.510
I won't let you!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:07.780
This will be your opponent!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:17.010
The seal is broken!
He did something unnecessary...

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.180
Oh! Finally!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:40.950
That is the true form of your mother, Princess Katsurako,

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.850
after absorbing the Horrors within her!

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:52.190
Now, release your hatred!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.060
Wh-What are you doing, Seimei?!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.570
Raiko!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.220
Hurry and get on!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.060
Right.

00:20:55.920 --> 00:21:00.590
Seimei, the reason you wanted to release your mother...

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:03.230
Like Madou Rings and Madou statues,

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:08.700
I honed my skill of sealing
Horrors into Madou tools.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.070
All for this day.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:18.780
As I thought, the light within you does not fade, Seimei.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:20.310
Douma Houshi!

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:24.590
I was looking forward to watching you coldly kill your mother's Horror

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:31.930
or fall to darkness as you suffer from your inability to do so.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.130
I never thought you'd turn her into your Madou tool.

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:40.190
All humans waver between light and darkness.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.600
I only have darkness!

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:49.410
Who was the one next to Douman?

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:53.180
Douma Houshi, the previous Ashiya Douman.

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.580
Previous?

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:59.020
You were worried about me?

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:00.450
What are you saying?

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:03.550
I can now summon my armor without you!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.690
Oh? Oh? Oh? Oh?

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.130
Hey, Seimei! Hey!

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:13.130
--Be honest, Raiko.
--You're too close!

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:14.970
Sorry.

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:18.100
You are a Makai Knight, just for me.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:38.130
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:45.070
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:52.240
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:02.750
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.220
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.660
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:48.390
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:51.030 --> 00:24:01.040
"Next Episode: BROTHERS"

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:55.280
Things gained from loss.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:58.700
It is from that lack, that light begins to grow.
